    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A special van has appeared in the square outside "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Cloud Nine Plaza",
            "zh": "龙之梦广场"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Changning District, Shanghai. This eye-catching van serves two functions: it sells coffee and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "promotes",
            "ref": "v-promote"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the adoption of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "stray cats",
            "zh": "流浪猫"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The van is decorated in bright orange with lovely cat-related "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "elements",
            "ref": "v-element"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It serves as the temporary home for two friendly stray cats. People who visit the van can interact with the cats through the window. If they want to help these cats, they can donate money to support their care. They can even apply to adopt them and give them a real home."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The van offers seven different types of coffee. All drinks are made by "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "baristas",
            "zh": "咖啡师"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with hearing problems. “The coffee machines are specially designed to be easy to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "operate",
            "ref": "v-operate"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” said one of the leaders of the program. “The baristas can learn to use them quickly after some simple training.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Over the next three years, there will be about 100 such vans placed throughout the city. This expansion will create many "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "stable",
            "ref": "v-stable"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " job "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "opportunities",
            "ref": "v-opportunity"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for people with hearing problems. Meanwhile, all the money from the sale of coffee will go to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "charity",
            "ref": "v-charity"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " programs that help stray cats. This project not only provides jobs but also shows care for animals in the community."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
